      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i noticed in the list you categorized the Vietnam War protests as regressive and stubborn. some historians argue that those protests were actually a crucial part of a progressive push for civil liberties and international human rights. shouldn't the lesson plan reflect that it's a contested debate rather than just labeling it as regressive?",
